(4346919, 626541, 9668, '<td valign="top">Ooh da looly, I''ll look for this on the homepage. <br/>Edges look a bit over vignetted to me, but maybe that''s just my opinion. At the same time that I like the editing, I don''t like it. I like it because it draws me into the image and has a great tonal value and emotional impact. But I don''t like it because it looks unreal. The edges really that dark? The sand really that bright just right there? The lighting on the surf really like bright on one side and faded on the other? Really? <br/>Nitpick: the title could be a lot simpler imho. Something like "Lizard Rock" or "Between" would have sufficed. <br/>Another nitpick, rock looks oversharpened. All that being said, I love how this image turned out, and I''m sure the rest of DPC will as well. And that''s why I say I look forward to seeing in in the top 3. I hope to join you there, but I guess we''ll see.</td>', 'Ooh da looly, I''ll look for this on the homepage. Edges look a bit over vignetted to me, but maybe that''s just my opinion. At the same time that I like the editing, I don''t like it. I like it because it draws me into the image and has a great tonal value and emotional impact. But I don''t like it because it looks unreal. The edges really that dark? The sand really that bright just right there? The lighting on the surf really like bright on one side and faded on the other? Really? Nitpick: the title could be a lot simpler imho. Something like "Lizard Rock" or "Between" would have sufficed. Another nitpick, rock looks oversharpened. All that being said, I love how this image turned out, and I''m sure the rest of DPC will as well. And that''s why I say I look forward to seeing in in the top 3. I hope to join you there, but I guess we''ll see.', '2007-12-31 06:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4346920, 625974, 9668, '<td valign="top">nice flock! I hope you didn''t Art Wolfe this (like the editing done for his shot "Migrations). Beautiful image, and I fully think this meets the challenge.</td>', 'nice flock! I hope you didn''t Art Wolfe this (like the editing done for his shot "Migrations). Beautiful image, and I fully think this meets the challenge.', '2007-12-31 06:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
