(4347177, 626213, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great minimalism.  I also like the contrast of shapes with the arched area over the rectangular doorway.  This is funky and arty.  I dig it. ;~D</td>', 'Great minimalism.  I also like the contrast of shapes with the arched area over the rectangular doorway.  This is funky and arty.  I dig it. ;~D', '2007-12-31 08:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347180, 625845, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is really unexpected. Is it inside a building?  I love the angle and perspective to create the diagonal line amidst the squares on the floor and the vertical lines of the red backdrop.  Pretty!! 7</td>', 'This is really unexpected. Is it inside a building?  I love the angle and perspective to create the diagonal line amidst the squares on the floor and the vertical lines of the red backdrop.  Pretty!! 7', '2007-12-31 08:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347183, 627221, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the acid colors and the sharp blacks with that WHITE of the sun. 7</td>', 'I love the acid colors and the sharp blacks with that WHITE of the sun. 7', '2007-12-31 08:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347187, 627079, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just love that kitty.  If it were mine, I might play with the sharpen tool a smidge on the whiskers, but that''s just me. Love the use of neg. space.</td>', 'I just love that kitty.  If it were mine, I might play with the sharpen tool a smidge on the whiskers, but that''s just me. Love the use of neg. space.', '2007-12-31 08:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347189, 625835, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the tendrils. With the angle of her legs, it almost has a beautiful spiderlike feel to it. I''m assuming the slight tilt to the right is intentional. Since it has such nice symmetry, I might''ve had it level, but that''s just me. She is truly lovely.</td>', 'Love the tendrils. With the angle of her legs, it almost has a beautiful spiderlike feel to it. I''m assuming the slight tilt to the right is intentional. Since it has such nice symmetry, I might''ve had it level, but that''s just me. She is truly lovely.', '2007-12-31 08:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347191, 625277, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple and so well done. I might''ve made the sky a touch more black so that the contrast of the moon and mountaintop was even more impactful. 7</td>', 'Simple and so well done. I might''ve made the sky a touch more black so that the contrast of the moon and mountaintop was even more impactful. 7', '2007-12-31 08:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347192, 627402, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely and quite simple.  It has an elegance. Would make a lovely print. 7</td>', 'Lovely and quite simple.  It has an elegance. Would make a lovely print. 7', '2007-12-31 08:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347194, 627391, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has classic appeal.</td>', 'This has classic appeal.', '2007-12-31 08:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347195, 626985, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a nice variation from the norm and tells a story, yet leaves enough to the viewer''s imagination, to come to their own conclusion. I might''ve upped the deepness of the midtones a bit more but that''s just me. 7</td>', 'This has a nice variation from the norm and tells a story, yet leaves enough to the viewer''s imagination, to come to their own conclusion. I might''ve upped the deepness of the midtones a bit more but that''s just me. 7', '2007-12-31 08:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347196, 626492, 15711, '<td valign="top">He''s lovely. I like how the blurred bokeh almost mimicks the long fur on his main. Great use of neg space. Terrific lighting. This would be beautiful in black and white too. ;~D</td>', 'He''s lovely. I like how the blurred bokeh almost mimicks the long fur on his main. Great use of neg space. Terrific lighting. This would be beautiful in black and white too. ;~D', '2007-12-31 08:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347204, 625266, 15711, '<td valign="top">Such a simple thing yet so classic.  Wonderful bokeh. I like all of the lines whether they be the straight ones of the feeder and string, or the irregular ones of the deep dark branches.  I can see this as a greeting card for the holiday season.  Good luck!! 8</td>', 'Such a simple thing yet so classic.  Wonderful bokeh. I like all of the lines whether they be the straight ones of the feeder and string, or the irregular ones of the deep dark branches.  I can see this as a greeting card for the holiday season.  Good luck!! 8', '2007-12-31 09:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347210, 627537, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a dreamlike feel. I love the angle and perspective.  I wonder if adjusting contrast a bit more would''ve enhanced it even further. Hmmm - just thinking out loud.</td>', 'This has a dreamlike feel. I love the angle and perspective.  I wonder if adjusting contrast a bit more would''ve enhanced it even further. Hmmm - just thinking out loud.', '2007-12-31 09:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347214, 627546, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is my kind of shot.  Simple, graphic and includes a crisp silhouette.  Well done.</td>', 'This is my kind of shot.  Simple, graphic and includes a crisp silhouette.  Well done.', '2007-12-31 09:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347215, 625423, 77543, '<td valign="top">There is so much white in the background that the contrast with the swan is reduced. So in my opinion it doesn''t meet the challenge very well.</td>', 'There is so much white in the background that the contrast with the swan is reduced. So in my opinion it doesn''t meet the challenge very well.', '2007-12-31 09:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
