(4347521, 625660, 72318, '<td valign="top">A bit soft :(</td>', 'A bit soft :(', '2007-12-31 11:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347525, 627422, 72318, '<td valign="top">Not being a universal sign for "stop" makes title connection hard and also the fact that the "subject" is lost within a lot of light dark contrast of a big scene (the only contrast here is the colour) i cant say you have effectively isolated the subject here...</td>', 'Not being a universal sign for "stop" makes title connection hard and also the fact that the "subject" is lost within a lot of light dark contrast of a big scene (the only contrast here is the colour) i cant say you have effectively isolated the subject here...', '2007-12-31 11:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347527, 625835, 72318, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... this is on my list to do at some point, excellent execution.</td>', 'Beautiful... this is on my list to do at some point, excellent execution.', '2007-12-31 11:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347530, 626777, 72318, '<td valign="top">Might have been even more effective had the whole scene been lit evenly i feel.  Nicely done anyway.</td>', 'Might have been even more effective had the whole scene been lit evenly i feel.  Nicely done anyway.', '2007-12-31 11:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347536, 627083, 72318, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this before and really want to know how to get those perfect swirls (pm me please? :)). Apart from my feeling that the space on the left is redundant, this is a strong entry. :)</td>', 'I''ve seen this before and really want to know how to get those perfect swirls (pm me please? :)). Apart from my feeling that the space on the left is redundant, this is a strong entry. :)', '2007-12-31 11:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347538, 627319, 72318, '<td valign="top">This is going to ribbon i expect... very nicely composed and love the volume light - sure hope it is real.</td>', 'This is going to ribbon i expect... very nicely composed and love the volume light - sure hope it is real.', '2007-12-31 11:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347540, 625845, 34938, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this...it''s a striking image, deep and rich. I like the water as well as it adds to the depth 8</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this...it''s a striking image, deep and rich. I like the water as well as it adds to the depth 8', '2007-12-31 11:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347543, 625352, 34938, '<td valign="top">I really like the light, colour, tones and quirkiness of the image 8</td>', 'I really like the light, colour, tones and quirkiness of the image 8', '2007-12-31 11:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347555, 627319, 83600, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2007-12-31 11:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347560, 627530, 70000, '<td valign="top">nice use of the challenge subject. This doesn''t have as much detail as I think people would expect on dpc but I still really like it. The two different tones of neutral color offset by the flower is neat and the positioning of it is also well done. Congrats</td>', 'nice use of the challenge subject. This doesn''t have as much detail as I think people would expect on dpc but I still really like it. The two different tones of neutral color offset by the flower is neat and the positioning of it is also well done. Congrats', '2007-12-31 11:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347561, 625277, 70000, '<td valign="top">Wow, STUNNING nightscape!</td>', 'Wow, STUNNING nightscape!', '2007-12-31 11:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347563, 627121, 70000, '<td valign="top">HAHAHAHAHAHA....This is brilliant. Just BRILLIANT!!! The lines are done amazingly well, this is perfeclty composed and the subject...wow just perfect for this challenge.</td>', 'HAHAHAHAHAHA....This is brilliant. Just BRILLIANT!!! The lines are done amazingly well, this is perfeclty composed and the subject...wow just perfect for this challenge.', '2007-12-31 11:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347565, 627144, 70000, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The water has a wonderful sense of diagonal motion and I wish that the rocks weren''t dead center because it feels like it just stops the motion. Still, very welldont</td>', 'Interesting. The water has a wonderful sense of diagonal motion and I wish that the rocks weren''t dead center because it feels like it just stops the motion. Still, very welldont', '2007-12-31 11:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347566, 627505, 83600, '<td valign="top">What a beutiful shot. Love it. Firstly I  looked at the windmill, flag etc and then the contrast of the ? "farm equepment" very nice</td>', 'What a beutiful shot. Love it. Firstly I  looked at the windmill, flag etc and then the contrast of the ? "farm equepment" very nice', '2007-12-31 11:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347570, 627144, 83600, '<td valign="top">Beutiful 8</td>', 'Beutiful 8', '2007-12-31 11:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347572, 627321, 83600, '<td valign="top">I like, Stunning 9</td>', 'I like, Stunning 9', '2007-12-31 11:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347576, 627298, 83600, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, great position, looks like he had u in his sights! 8</td>', 'Awesome shot, great position, looks like he had u in his sights! 8', '2007-12-31 11:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347579, 627533, 70000, '<td valign="top">Interesting batch of flowers. They look so soft!</td>', 'Interesting batch of flowers. They look so soft!', '2007-12-31 11:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347580, 627540, 23484, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I love the starkness.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I love the starkness.', '2007-12-31 11:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347590, 626213, 31829, '<td valign="top">Eastern State?</td>', 'Eastern State?', '2007-12-31 11:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347591, 627129, 70000, '<td valign="top">Funny thing, I looked at this and said...hmmm? Interesting composition and makes me really want to look closer to see whats going on. The bird pirtched on the stick to the left is a very nice touch!!</td>', 'Funny thing, I looked at this and said...hmmm? Interesting composition and makes me really want to look closer to see whats going on. The bird pirtched on the stick to the left is a very nice touch!!', '2007-12-31 11:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347593, 627208, 70000, '<td valign="top">The perspective is cool here. The yellow really pops in contrast to the background. Cool!</td>', 'The perspective is cool here. The yellow really pops in contrast to the background. Cool!', '2007-12-31 11:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347595, 627074, 77543, '<td valign="top">A slower shutter speed would have helped make an even stronger contrast.</td>', 'A slower shutter speed would have helped make an even stronger contrast.', '2007-12-31 11:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347599, 626213, 70000, '<td valign="top">Wow what a cool location. I would love to do some wacky fashion portraits. What is the painted doorway for? This raises questions and I like that. Fits the challenge very well too</td>', 'Wow what a cool location. I would love to do some wacky fashion portraits. What is the painted doorway for? This raises questions and I like that. Fits the challenge very well too', '2007-12-31 11:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347602, 626818, 70000, '<td valign="top">I love the angles and the way you positioned her in the frame. The motion blur adds to the shot too I think. The colors are a little goofy but it is still a nice shot.</td>', 'I love the angles and the way you positioned her in the frame. The motion blur adds to the shot too I think. The colors are a little goofy but it is still a nice shot.', '2007-12-31 11:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347605, 627548, 77543, '<td valign="top">The fade into the distance is good. Unfortunately it''s overexposed and out of focus at the other end. I think the snow ruins this shot. Re-shoot when it stops snowing and you''ll have an excellent shot for a different challenge.</td>', 'The fade into the distance is good. Unfortunately it''s overexposed and out of focus at the other end. I think the snow ruins this shot. Re-shoot when it stops snowing and you''ll have an excellent shot for a different challenge.', '2007-12-31 11:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347606, 627113, 70000, '<td valign="top">Very cool! I wish I could come to one of these gatherings. The lines passing across the frame add depth which is cool and I love how all the photographers are dressed and positioned differently but still make a very nice cohesive group</td>', 'Very cool! I wish I could come to one of these gatherings. The lines passing across the frame add depth which is cool and I love how all the photographers are dressed and positioned differently but still make a very nice cohesive group', '2007-12-31 11:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347607, 627391, 70000, '<td valign="top">VERY cool perspective here. I love how big the star looks in comparison to everything else. Very neat</td>', 'VERY cool perspective here. I love how big the star looks in comparison to everything else. Very neat', '2007-12-31 11:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347608, 627348, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot but the centered composition is a bit stagnant I think. There is this great diagonal line you have going with the stick leading to the dog and the space at the right doesn''t really add anything to it.</td>', 'This is a neat shot but the centered composition is a bit stagnant I think. There is this great diagonal line you have going with the stick leading to the dog and the space at the right doesn''t really add anything to it.', '2007-12-31 11:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347610, 627542, 70000, '<td valign="top">Very cute! the pink really pops. Nice perspective</td>', 'Very cute! the pink really pops. Nice perspective', '2007-12-31 11:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347611, 627032, 70000, '<td valign="top">The shapes really stand out. You must have been far away! Really cool shot.</td>', 'The shapes really stand out. You must have been far away! Really cool shot.', '2007-12-31 11:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347612, 626571, 70000, '<td valign="top">Wow the motion blur here is awesome! and she is so in focus! I am impressed :)</td>', 'Wow the motion blur here is awesome! and she is so in focus! I am impressed :)', '2007-12-31 11:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347617, 627255, 70000, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this is fabulous! very well composed too</td>', 'The lighting in this is fabulous! very well composed too', '2007-12-31 11:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347618, 627358, 47091, '<td valign="top">They are to washed out to me</td>', 'They are to washed out to me', '2007-12-31 11:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347619, 627298, 77543, '<td valign="top">Since this is a bird in flight I''ll assume the sky was virtually white to start with and very little editing has been done. In which case this is an excellent shot that meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Since this is a bird in flight I''ll assume the sky was virtually white to start with and very little editing has been done. In which case this is an excellent shot that meets the challenge well.', '2007-12-31 11:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347624, 627063, 77543, '<td valign="top">There is so much variation in "white" tones throughout the background that there is little contrast with the equally numerous tones in the subject. so in my opinion it fails to meet the challenge very well.</td>', 'There is so much variation in "white" tones throughout the background that there is little contrast with the equally numerous tones in the subject. so in my opinion it fails to meet the challenge very well.', '2007-12-31 11:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347635, 627504, 65106, '<td valign="top">The two lit rocks slashing through the frame would have worked so well ...</td>', 'The two lit rocks slashing through the frame would have worked so well ...', '2007-12-31 12:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347640, 625531, 77543, '<td valign="top">If the "subject" is the red elements on the girl''s dress then this meets the challenge. However I doubt that was the intention in this picture in which case it fails to meet the challenge since there is very little to separate the girl at the front from the other three children. Additionally there is a partially cut of head at the top of the frame that looks very bad.</td>', 'If the "subject" is the red elements on the girl''s dress then this meets the challenge. However I doubt that was the intention in this picture in which case it fails to meet the challenge since there is very little to separate the girl at the front from the other three children. Additionally there is a partially cut of head at the top of the frame that looks very bad.', '2007-12-31 12:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347642, 627037, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming the dog is the subject here. If the background consisted of just the legs of the person behind then it would fit the challenge quite well and is likely to be a pretty good picture. However much of the image consists of a rather cluttered mess.</td>', 'I''m assuming the dog is the subject here. If the background consisted of just the legs of the person behind then it would fit the challenge quite well and is likely to be a pretty good picture. However much of the image consists of a rather cluttered mess.', '2007-12-31 12:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347647, 627529, 77543, '<td valign="top">A bold use of empty space or a cynical attempt to enter as many pixels as possible.</td>', 'A bold use of empty space or a cynical attempt to enter as many pixels as possible.', '2007-12-31 12:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347649, 626878, 77543, '<td valign="top">The main "shape" has been cut off at the top. I think I would have cropped the right hand edge.</td>', 'The main "shape" has been cut off at the top. I think I would have cropped the right hand edge.', '2007-12-31 12:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347652, 627404, 77543, '<td valign="top">I don''t see much contrast here. The thin strip of sunlight is nice but since it doesn''t light up the entire subject it doesn''t really meet the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t see much contrast here. The thin strip of sunlight is nice but since it doesn''t light up the entire subject it doesn''t really meet the challenge.', '2007-12-31 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347656, 626984, 77543, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge well. I''d crop the lower part of this image below the water with the reflection.</td>', 'This meets the challenge well. I''d crop the lower part of this image below the water with the reflection.', '2007-12-31 12:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347668, 626199, 77543, '<td valign="top">Is it an over-exposed silhouette or an under-exposed shot. Either way there are too many competing branches for the subject to stand out well.</td>', 'Is it an over-exposed silhouette or an under-exposed shot. Either way there are too many competing branches for the subject to stand out well.', '2007-12-31 12:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347674, 627549, 77543, '<td valign="top">I think the post processing has removed most contrast in this shot and there is little in the composition that says contrast. I don''t get the point of the artificial colouring around the face hair and window frame.</td>', 'I think the post processing has removed most contrast in this shot and there is little in the composition that says contrast. I don''t get the point of the artificial colouring around the face hair and window frame.', '2007-12-31 12:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347679, 627491, 65106, '<td valign="top">Can''t really tell what is being isolated.</td>', 'Can''t really tell what is being isolated.', '2007-12-31 12:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347699, 626972, 65106, '<td valign="top">What is the subject?</td>', 'What is the subject?', '2007-12-31 12:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347701, 625976, 65106, '<td valign="top">what is being isolated?</td>', 'what is being isolated?', '2007-12-31 12:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347703, 627037, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos I wish I had taken.  Spectacular!</td>', 'This is one of those photos I wish I had taken.  Spectacular!', '2007-12-31 12:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347704, 627057, 1024, '<td valign="top">Wow!!  Not much I can add to that.</td>', 'Wow!!  Not much I can add to that.', '2007-12-31 12:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347705, 627370, 65106, '<td valign="top">Nothing seems isolated here.</td>', 'Nothing seems isolated here.', '2007-12-31 12:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347720, 627200, 47091, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow</td>', 'I like the shadow', '2007-12-31 12:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347721, 627319, 47091, '<td valign="top">Awesome</td>', 'Awesome', '2007-12-31 12:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347722, 625352, 80859, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful.  the colouring, lighting, subject, the thoughtful composition... all perfect.  i love the feel.  /10</td>', 'this is beautiful.  the colouring, lighting, subject, the thoughtful composition... all perfect.  i love the feel.  /10', '2007-12-31 12:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347723, 627547, 80859, '<td valign="top">i love the V shape of the clouds and the perspective.  the red tunnel is definitely isolated by contrast.  beautiful!  /10</td>', 'i love the V shape of the clouds and the perspective.  the red tunnel is definitely isolated by contrast.  beautiful!  /10', '2007-12-31 12:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347728, 627530, 77543, '<td valign="top">It looks very soft in a way that isn''t intentional.</td>', 'It looks very soft in a way that isn''t intentional.', '2007-12-31 12:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347730, 627191, 77543, '<td valign="top">The blue contrasts well with the wall but the heavy shadows merge the hats into the wall. So it only partly meets the challenge.</td>', 'The blue contrasts well with the wall but the heavy shadows merge the hats into the wall. So it only partly meets the challenge.', '2007-12-31 12:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347731, 627535, 77543, '<td valign="top">Good colour and focus contrast. However, the foreground flowers needs a bit more depth of field.</td>', 'Good colour and focus contrast. However, the foreground flowers needs a bit more depth of field.', '2007-12-31 12:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4347732, 627344, 77543, '<td valign="top">The leaves range from being in focus and far out of focus. There is not a clear distinction between them so it''s not clear what the "subject" is that is being separated.</td>', 'The leaves range from being in focus and far out of focus. There is not a clear distinction between them so it''s not clear what the "subject" is that is being separated.', '2007-12-31 12:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
