(4348514, 627362, 79955, '<td valign="top">Careful on the framing and the composition, current crop not too clean (at the top) and the image seems off balanced - 5</td>', 'Careful on the framing and the composition, current crop not too clean (at the top) and the image seems off balanced - 5', '2007-12-31 19:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348519, 625531, 79955, '<td valign="top">wonderful candid shot , love their expressions &amp; yes I like her dress - 7</td>', 'wonderful candid shot , love their expressions & yes I like her dress - 7', '2007-12-31 19:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348524, 627151, 60915, '<td valign="top">oh my!!!</td>', 'oh my!!!', '2007-12-31 19:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348526, 627505, 60915, '<td valign="top">very picture postcard! : )</td>', 'very picture postcard! : )', '2007-12-31 19:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348535, 626984, 60915, '<td valign="top">I like how even though he''s alone, he still has his reflection! : )</td>', 'I like how even though he''s alone, he still has his reflection! : )', '2007-12-31 19:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348541, 625553, 60915, '<td valign="top">Like exploding fireworks! : )</td>', 'Like exploding fireworks! : )', '2007-12-31 19:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348542, 627184, 80859, '<td valign="top">nice composition, but the white knight is not very white though i see how it looks a bit isolated and the white king doesn''t look white at all.</td>', 'nice composition, but the white knight is not very white though i see how it looks a bit isolated and the white king doesn''t look white at all.', '2007-12-31 19:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348543, 625976, 80859, '<td valign="top">the white spaces on the board are not very white and the left side of the background is blown out.  the right side of the background has that dark vertical line distracting from the rest of the photo.  i also would have had the pieces set up in which they would illustrate the title better such as having the white king in jeopardy.</td>', 'the white spaces on the board are not very white and the left side of the background is blown out.  the right side of the background has that dark vertical line distracting from the rest of the photo.  i also would have had the pieces set up in which they would illustrate the title better such as having the white king in jeopardy.', '2007-12-31 19:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348545, 627221, 60915, '<td valign="top">Drama! : )<br/>I love the acid! : )</td>', 'Drama! : )I love the acid! : )', '2007-12-31 20:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348548, 626371, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic!</td>', 'This is fantastic!', '2007-12-31 20:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348549, 627097, 43774, '<td valign="top">Is this a raven or a crow? I can never tell the difference. Great job on the exposure.</td>', 'Is this a raven or a crow? I can never tell the difference. Great job on the exposure.', '2007-12-31 20:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348550, 627529, 43774, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo, I can''t decide if I like the look of the tulip or the water in the vase best of all.</td>', 'A beautiful photo, I can''t decide if I like the look of the tulip or the water in the vase best of all.', '2007-12-31 20:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348551, 627035, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute and fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Cute and fits the challenge well.', '2007-12-31 20:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348552, 627505, 43774, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing scene.</td>', 'A very pleasing scene.', '2007-12-31 20:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348553, 625266, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and clear, a lovely photo</td>', 'Very sharp and clear, a lovely photo', '2007-12-31 20:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348554, 627545, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the dark yet fragile looking leaf against the pale backdrop.</td>', 'Love the dark yet fragile looking leaf against the pale backdrop.', '2007-12-31 20:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348555, 627003, 60915, '<td valign="top">Nice use of blur and sharp as a contrast! : )</td>', 'Nice use of blur and sharp as a contrast! : )', '2007-12-31 20:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348558, 627330, 60915, '<td valign="top">Love it! One of my faves in this challenge! : )<br/>Very much my kinda image! : )</td>', 'Love it! One of my faves in this challenge! : )Very much my kinda image! : )', '2007-12-31 20:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348560, 627191, 60915, '<td valign="top">Deb? Light and comp is perfect! : )</td>', 'Deb? Light and comp is perfect! : )', '2007-12-31 20:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348562, 627144, 60915, '<td valign="top">A beautiful little corner of the world! : )</td>', 'A beautiful little corner of the world! : )', '2007-12-31 20:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348567, 626985, 60915, '<td valign="top">Excellent!<br/>Has a wonderfully sinister feel to the mans shadow trailing the girl!<br/>She doesn''t appear to even know he''s following! Creates a nice tension.<br/>Like straight from a movie! : )</td>', 'Excellent!Has a wonderfully sinister feel to the mans shadow trailing the girl!She doesn''t appear to even know he''s following! Creates a nice tension.Like straight from a movie! : )', '2007-12-31 20:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348569, 627013, 63269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - I like the simplicity of the bright colors.</td>', 'Beautiful - I like the simplicity of the bright colors.', '2007-12-31 20:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348571, 627332, 60915, '<td valign="top">hehe, what a bunch of dudes!: ) Love all the expressions! : )</td>', 'hehe, what a bunch of dudes!: ) Love all the expressions! : )', '2007-12-31 20:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348574, 625974, 60915, '<td valign="top">amazing! : )</td>', 'amazing! : )', '2007-12-31 20:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348575, 627128, 60915, '<td valign="top">What a great find! : )</td>', 'What a great find! : )', '2007-12-31 20:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348577, 626523, 60915, '<td valign="top">Yay! : )</td>', 'Yay! : )', '2007-12-31 20:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348624, 627016, 74533, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm. Interesting portrait.  I dont think it quite fits the challenge but good photo all the same.  I see you''ve used a lense that distorts the portrait.  This is interesting in a good and unconventional way.  Looks like someone on the other side of the door looking through the peephole.  I guess that I was hoping to see something that is markedly disassociated from the rest of the picture.  The subject takes up about 80% of the frame not leaving much room for isolating it from the rest of the scene. Thats why I feel it doesn''t really meet the challenge for me.</td>', 'Hmmmm. Interesting portrait.  I dont think it quite fits the challenge but good photo all the same.  I see you''ve used a lense that distorts the portrait.  This is interesting in a good and unconventional way.  Looks like someone on the other side of the door looking through the peephole.  I guess that I was hoping to see something that is markedly disassociated from the rest of the picture.  The subject takes up about 80% of the frame not leaving much room for isolating it from the rest of the scene. Thats why I feel it doesn''t really meet the challenge for me.', '2007-12-31 20:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348629, 625835, 28261, '<td valign="top">My Blue Ribbon Pick.  An amazing high key entry!</td>', 'My Blue Ribbon Pick.  An amazing high key entry!', '2007-12-31 21:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348645, 625835, 61818, '<td valign="top">Judi?  This is the best shot in the challenge bar none, and the best shot of yours I have seen to date to be honest.  I hope this ribbons.  10.</td>', 'Judi?  This is the best shot in the challenge bar none, and the best shot of yours I have seen to date to be honest.  I hope this ribbons.  10.', '2007-12-31 21:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348648, 627144, 80859, '<td valign="top">beautiful contrastat the top and bottom of the rocks. great photo</td>', 'beautiful contrastat the top and bottom of the rocks. great photo', '2007-12-31 21:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348671, 625423, 80859, '<td valign="top">the swan is isolated by contrast.  the effect on the water is pretty neat, but i don''t like that it looks like she''s trying to swim through an oil spill. the brightness in the background also takes my eyes away from her. /6</td>', 'the swan is isolated by contrast.  the effect on the water is pretty neat, but i don''t like that it looks like she''s trying to swim through an oil spill. the brightness in the background also takes my eyes away from her. /6', '2007-12-31 21:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348676, 627511, 80859, '<td valign="top">aside from a little bit of shadow creeping in near the outside of her right eye, i love the left side of this photo.  the way it''s  lit and the shadow outlining her nose and lips.  but... the left eye just doesn''t not look right to me at all.  it looks like her eye is bloodshot with some weird red eye make-up going on.</td>', 'aside from a little bit of shadow creeping in near the outside of her right eye, i love the left side of this photo.  the way it''s  lit and the shadow outlining her nose and lips.  but... the left eye just doesn''t not look right to me at all.  it looks like her eye is bloodshot with some weird red eye make-up going on.', '2007-12-31 21:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348704, 627121, 80859, '<td valign="top">i''ll take the snickers :)  very creative contrast.  the snickers bar seems a little oversharp to me.  i also like that you don''t have the usual blinding white background.</td>', 'i''ll take the snickers :)  very creative contrast.  the snickers bar seems a little oversharp to me.  i also like that you don''t have the usual blinding white background.', '2007-12-31 21:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348717, 627298, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is very strange without some sort of background for reference.</td>', 'This is very strange without some sort of background for reference.', '2007-12-31 22:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348718, 626571, 1024, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sense of freedom and movement.  Delightful to view, wish i was riding along!</td>', 'Beautiful sense of freedom and movement.  Delightful to view, wish i was riding along!', '2007-12-31 22:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348750, 625982, 80859, '<td valign="top">lovely..looks like he posed for you.  love the contrast.</td>', 'lovely..looks like he posed for you.  love the contrast.', '2007-12-31 22:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348757, 627054, 80859, '<td valign="top">perfectly beautiful.  well-done.</td>', 'perfectly beautiful.  well-done.', '2007-12-31 22:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348772, 625835, 78599, '<td valign="top">Wow! absolutely brilliant! Happy new year!</td>', 'Wow! absolutely brilliant! Happy new year!', '2007-12-31 23:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348799, 627358, 80859, '<td valign="top">i think you over-isolated somewhat.</td>', 'i think you over-isolated somewhat.', '2007-12-31 23:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348889, 627545, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is a winner for me, probably won''t win, which makes me sad...but this is awesome! I love the patterns and the contrast</td>', 'This is a winner for me, probably won''t win, which makes me sad...but this is awesome! I love the patterns and the contrast', '2008-01-01 00:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4348941, 625835, 51750, '<td valign="top">What an awkward pose. I like the lighting though.</td>', 'What an awkward pose. I like the lighting though.', '2008-01-01 01:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349093, 627200, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome perspective.  Really like this.  Not sure of the unnaturalness of the black sky, but it works very well here.</td>', 'Awesome perspective.  Really like this.  Not sure of the unnaturalness of the black sky, but it works very well here.', '2008-01-01 02:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349096, 625845, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple, very effective, and a very nice response to the challenge.</td>', 'Simple, very effective, and a very nice response to the challenge.', '2008-01-01 02:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349108, 627191, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice comp and use of the shadows to frame the subject.</td>', 'Nice comp and use of the shadows to frame the subject.', '2008-01-01 02:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349112, 627545, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice b/w usage. Do they still deliver milk in bottles like this anywhere? Nice blast from the past.</td>', 'Nice b/w usage. Do they still deliver milk in bottles like this anywhere? Nice blast from the past.', '2008-01-01 02:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349117, 626123, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice. Too bad there was no way of avoiding yourself and the camera in the reflection.</td>', 'Nice. Too bad there was no way of avoiding yourself and the camera in the reflection.', '2008-01-01 02:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349119, 626184, 83313, '<td valign="top">Lovely blue. the whole thing is detailed and clear.</td>', 'Lovely blue. the whole thing is detailed and clear.', '2008-01-01 02:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349129, 627308, 83313, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but I''m just not finding much interest in this. I do like the way you tried to use the natural contrast of the shadows vs the bright window. Perhaps more of a near perspective may have helped. Or if it were a glass or vase on the windowsill instead.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but I''m just not finding much interest in this. I do like the way you tried to use the natural contrast of the shadows vs the bright window. Perhaps more of a near perspective may have helped. Or if it were a glass or vase on the windowsill instead.', '2008-01-01 02:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349134, 627422, 83313, '<td valign="top">Taking advantage of all that icy weather up north, I see. I like the texture of the partially covered branches, and bridges are always interesting subjects. I''m not sure if it''s the composition or distractions such as the phone lines,  this comes in as good, but not great for me.</td>', 'Taking advantage of all that icy weather up north, I see. I like the texture of the partially covered branches, and bridges are always interesting subjects. I''m not sure if it''s the composition or distractions such as the phone lines,  this comes in as good, but not great for me.', '2008-01-01 03:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349139, 627252, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of a plain shot, lighting could have improved it some. I''m not sure exactly what to suggest though. Perhaps a look through the candy challenge from a few months back could give some ideas. I see some compression artifacts and looking at the file size of the image, it is a bout 2/3 the file size you could have used. Check your jpeg compression settings when saving for a challenge, in order to have the file come in as close to 150k as possible, without going over it.</td>', 'Kind of a plain shot, lighting could have improved it some. I''m not sure exactly what to suggest though. Perhaps a look through the candy challenge from a few months back could give some ideas. I see some compression artifacts and looking at the file size of the image, it is a bout 2/3 the file size you could have used. Check your jpeg compression settings when saving for a challenge, in order to have the file come in as close to 150k as possible, without going over it.', '2008-01-01 03:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349140, 625835, 30982, '<td valign="top">An impossible pose for all but very limber and talented young ladies!  Nicely done on all counts.</td>', 'An impossible pose for all but very limber and talented young ladies!  Nicely done on all counts.', '2008-01-01 03:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349142, 627423, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent title; love the grain.</td>', 'Excellent title; love the grain.', '2008-01-01 03:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349144, 627145, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of a centered composition.</td>', 'Very effective use of a centered composition.', '2008-01-01 03:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349145, 627037, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like this.</td>', 'I quite like this.', '2008-01-01 03:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349146, 627058, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent control of light and exposure!</td>', 'Excellent control of light and exposure!', '2008-01-01 03:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349150, 626775, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the small touch of color in the stained glass in the distance. The cross seems just a touch skewed, but it is what it is. Maybe a little too much empty space toward the top of the frame for me. Maybe a little more perspective to put the cross higher would have worked well.</td>', 'I like the small touch of color in the stained glass in the distance. The cross seems just a touch skewed, but it is what it is. Maybe a little too much empty space toward the top of the frame for me. Maybe a little more perspective to put the cross higher would have worked well.', '2008-01-01 03:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349151, 625660, 83313, '<td valign="top">Needs the colors and contrast tweaked a bit to make it pop.</td>', 'Needs the colors and contrast tweaked a bit to make it pop.', '2008-01-01 03:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349153, 627536, 83313, '<td valign="top">This one''s going to do well. Punchy colors, plus lots of detail and interest.</td>', 'This one''s going to do well. Punchy colors, plus lots of detail and interest.', '2008-01-01 03:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349156, 627498, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea.</td>', 'Very creative idea.', '2008-01-01 03:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349159, 625352, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Ecellent use of the theme and very moody. (Hope that''s not the infamous Olan-Mills library backdrop!)</td>', 'Very well done. Ecellent use of the theme and very moody. (Hope that''s not the infamous Olan-Mills library backdrop!)', '2008-01-01 03:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349165, 625423, 83313, '<td valign="top">I find the bright reflections on the water are a bit distracting from the bird, and that also takes away from the challenge subject to some extent.</td>', 'I find the bright reflections on the water are a bit distracting from the bird, and that also takes away from the challenge subject to some extent.', '2008-01-01 03:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349166, 626213, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is cool looking, and a little scary. I feel that I am stuck in this room with no way out.</td>', 'This is cool looking, and a little scary. I feel that I am stuck in this room with no way out.', '2008-01-01 03:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349174, 627016, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the bug eyed fisheye look of this. Overall I like it. The background is mildly distracting from the subject, the edges of the hair against the background appears a little harsh.</td>', 'I like the bug eyed fisheye look of this. Overall I like it. The background is mildly distracting from the subject, the edges of the hair against the background appears a little harsh.', '2008-01-01 03:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349176, 627319, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wow. I am sure a lot of careful editing went into this.</td>', 'Wow. I am sure a lot of careful editing went into this.', '2008-01-01 03:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349177, 627529, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like it. A touch more brightness on the leaf and stem would have been good, too. That a real nitpick, I think.</td>', 'I like it. A touch more brightness on the leaf and stem would have been good, too. That a real nitpick, I think.', '2008-01-01 03:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349179, 626303, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of several light sources. The silverware itself I am not thrilled with the appearance of, but the shadowplay is great.</td>', 'Interesting use of several light sources. The silverware itself I am not thrilled with the appearance of, but the shadowplay is great.', '2008-01-01 03:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349180, 626576, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Lots of texture showing.</td>', 'Nicely done. Lots of texture showing.', '2008-01-01 03:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349182, 627538, 83313, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective. I''d like to know how you shot this. I am guessing this is with the near egg on a pane of glass and the image flipped.</td>', 'Neat perspective. I''d like to know how you shot this. I am guessing this is with the near egg on a pane of glass and the image flipped.', '2008-01-01 03:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4349183, 627032, 83313, '<td valign="top">Shooting through the falling snow gives a neat look. Are they fishing in this weather? Looks like a pole in  the boys hand.</td>', 'Shooting through the falling snow gives a neat look. Are they fishing in this weather? Looks like a pole in  the boys hand.', '2008-01-01 03:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
