(4349201, 627549, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the effort, but the end result is not thrilling me. Seems forced and not the right look for this image. I hope that makes some sense. I think this is going to be one that will not have a lot of middle ground, voters will either really like it or won''t.</td>', 'I like the effort, but the end result is not thrilling me. Seems forced and not the right look for this image. I hope that makes some sense. I think this is going to be one that will not have a lot of middle ground, voters will either really like it or won''t.', '2008-01-01 03:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
