(4350758, 626992, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see some effort at an interesting perspective on tis. Unfortunately, there seems to be a lot of artifacting around the edge of the building and the straight lines have a lot of stair-stepping showing. Try different resampling settings when you downsize images like this. The clouds also came through as grainy and patchy rather than the really cool look that I am sure they had in real life.</td>', 'I see some effort at an interesting perspective on tis. Unfortunately, there seems to be a lot of artifacting around the edge of the building and the straight lines have a lot of stair-stepping showing. Try different resampling settings when you downsize images like this. The clouds also came through as grainy and patchy rather than the really cool look that I am sure they had in real life.', '2008-01-01 17:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
