(4355274, 627121, 85886, '<td valign="top">Great idea - really original - but the colours are just too muted for a shot like this, which I think really relies on colour to let the reader know immediately what the other objects are.</td>', 'Great idea - really original - but the colours are just too muted for a shot like this, which I think really relies on colour to let the reader know immediately what the other objects are.', '2008-01-02 20:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355281, 627054, 85886, '<td valign="top">Hurray!!! Someone who knows what object isolation by contrast is AND beautiful execution.  This photo stands out a mile in comparison with the rest here.  Well done and thanks for not interpreting the challenge as just shooting anything and claiming object contrast and/or isolation!! :)</td>', 'Hurray!!! Someone who knows what object isolation by contrast is AND beautiful execution.  This photo stands out a mile in comparison with the rest here.  Well done and thanks for not interpreting the challenge as just shooting anything and claiming object contrast and/or isolation!! :)', '2008-01-02 20:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
