(4357017, 627532, 41206, '<td valign="top">pan is a good idea, but in my opinion the subject is still a little too blurry (rear tire has motion blur). Perhaps a higher shutter speed would have helped, go to say 1/125, this looks like 1/60...but i may be wrong, just doesnt quite work. a 4</td>', 'pan is a good idea, but in my opinion the subject is still a little too blurry (rear tire has motion blur). Perhaps a higher shutter speed would have helped, go to say 1/125, this looks like 1/60...but i may be wrong, just doesnt quite work. a 4', '2008-01-03 10:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357026, 627097, 88010, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture!!! Focus is good, contrast perfect, details excellent. tones excellent</td>', 'Excellent capture!!! Focus is good, contrast perfect, details excellent. tones excellent', '2008-01-03 10:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357033, 626824, 88010, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea , well executed. But we acll it a fork?</td>', 'Very nice idea , well executed. But we acll it a fork?', '2008-01-03 10:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357055, 625660, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nicely contratsed.</td>', 'Nicely contratsed.', '2008-01-03 10:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357114, 627540, 88495, '<td valign="top">I think this is an excellent interpretation of the Challenge theme!</td>', 'I think this is an excellent interpretation of the Challenge theme!', '2008-01-03 10:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357240, 626541, 85886, '<td valign="top">Outstanding photograph.  This to me is a masterclass in texture and lighting!  Everything from the sharpness of the foreground sand to the details of the rock look amazing, with light and texture changes all over the place.  This is one of those photos I wish I''d taken :)  The only thing I think that could improve this photo would have been a more interesting sky, but hey, just being nitpicky.</td>', 'Outstanding photograph.  This to me is a masterclass in texture and lighting!  Everything from the sharpness of the foreground sand to the details of the rock look amazing, with light and texture changes all over the place.  This is one of those photos I wish I''d taken :)  The only thing I think that could improve this photo would have been a more interesting sky, but hey, just being nitpicky.', '2008-01-03 11:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357591, 626723, 62318, '<td valign="top">The silhouetted man is a nice contrast to the background and a good fit to the challenge. The whites seem a little overly bright, but not by much. This has a nice swirl feeling with the eye movement which I believe helps the photo.</td>', 'The silhouetted man is a nice contrast to the background and a good fit to the challenge. The whites seem a little overly bright, but not by much. This has a nice swirl feeling with the eye movement which I believe helps the photo.', '2008-01-03 14:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357593, 627255, 62318, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the one egg is terrific. I alos like how you can see the texture on the shell that is lit.</td>', 'The lighting on the one egg is terrific. I alos like how you can see the texture on the shell that is lit.', '2008-01-03 14:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357595, 625393, 62318, '<td valign="top">The berries pop very nicely from the background brown color. It might have been emphasized more with a slightly larger aperture, but the overall technique is nice.</td>', 'The berries pop very nicely from the background brown color. It might have been emphasized more with a slightly larger aperture, but the overall technique is nice.', '2008-01-03 14:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357597, 627063, 62318, '<td valign="top">You would think white on white would be difficult to contrast, but here it works nicely. The only thing I might suggest would to have the barn just slight to to the left. I like the texture work going on here.</td>', 'You would think white on white would be difficult to contrast, but here it works nicely. The only thing I might suggest would to have the barn just slight to to the left. I like the texture work going on here.', '2008-01-03 14:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357600, 627138, 62318, '<td valign="top">Three tone color contrast? Works well for me. I also really like the different texture contrast. Might have preferred a slight aperture, not sure though. Wonderful sharpness and bold colors.</td>', 'Three tone color contrast? Works well for me. I also really like the different texture contrast. Might have preferred a slight aperture, not sure though. Wonderful sharpness and bold colors.', '2008-01-03 14:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357606, 626136, 62318, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting as it really gives a wonderful depth to the photo. Maybe too much sky, curious how it would look as a square crop? Still nicely stated and presented. Good title to boot.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting as it really gives a wonderful depth to the photo. Maybe too much sky, curious how it would look as a square crop? Still nicely stated and presented. Good title to boot.', '2008-01-03 14:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357619, 625352, 62318, '<td valign="top">I just love the colors here. Simply superb. I see some touch edges against the background, not much but seems a little rough if you know what I mean. Still one of my favorites in the challenge. Love the mimicry of the two umbrellas. Not generally a fan of this type of work, but when done right as yours is it is truly wonderful.</td>', 'I just love the colors here. Simply superb. I see some touch edges against the background, not much but seems a little rough if you know what I mean. Still one of my favorites in the challenge. Love the mimicry of the two umbrellas. Not generally a fan of this type of work, but when done right as yours is it is truly wonderful.', '2008-01-03 14:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357624, 627032, 62318, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed this picture in the challenge. Simply understated and a terrific take on the challenge. One of my favorites in the challenge and overall in general.</td>', 'I really enjoyed this picture in the challenge. Simply understated and a terrific take on the challenge. One of my favorites in the challenge and overall in general.', '2008-01-03 14:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
