(4357985, 626492, 77192, '<td valign="top">I swore when I saw this shot, which is a good sign.<br/> <br/>The expression on the lion''s face is perfect, I love the framing and especially the light falling on his mane.<br/> <br/>It''s got a 10 from me (and a favourite), this might even break 8 overall if there''s any justice in the world.<br/> <br/>In short, the best photo I''ve seen on DPC in a fair long while, which is saying something considering the strength of the shots in this challenge alone.</td>', 'I swore when I saw this shot, which is a good sign. The expression on the lion''s face is perfect, I love the framing and especially the light falling on his mane. It''s got a 10 from me (and a favourite), this might even break 8 overall if there''s any justice in the world. In short, the best photo I''ve seen on DPC in a fair long while, which is saying something considering the strength of the shots in this challenge alone.', '2008-01-03 16:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
