(4362241, 626971, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is so odd yet so beautiful. I have no sense of scale, no idea how far the berries are from the pillars, or how big the pillars are... is it architecture or decoration? Is that worn stone or freshly shaped clay? It is, as you say, a song, or at least a verse, a few muttered phrases by a voice haunted and beautiful.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is so odd yet so beautiful. I have no sense of scale, no idea how far the berries are from the pillars, or how big the pillars are... is it architecture or decoration? Is that worn stone or freshly shaped clay? It is, as you say, a song, or at least a verse, a few muttered phrases by a voice haunted and beautiful. Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2008-01-05 00:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4362242, 626985, 50695, '<td valign="top">by using shadows only, the contrast *is* your subject. In a sense, you''ve fulfilled the challenge more perfectly than a literal interpretation. Or is the light the subject? It seems like a cinema projection on the wall. (Or is the window the subject, merely being imitated by the rest?) And this strange subject ambiguity (polyphony?) is only enhanced by the composition, with its profound sense of gravity (in more ways than one).<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'by using shadows only, the contrast *is* your subject. In a sense, you''ve fulfilled the challenge more perfectly than a literal interpretation. Or is the light the subject? It seems like a cinema projection on the wall. (Or is the window the subject, merely being imitated by the rest?) And this strange subject ambiguity (polyphony?) is only enhanced by the composition, with its profound sense of gravity (in more ways than one). Posthumous Blue Ribbon ', '2008-01-05 00:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4362243, 627517, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is the smallest ocean I have ever seen. Your sister is about to fold it up and put it in her pocket. I''ve never seen an image like this before.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon (tie) <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is the smallest ocean I have ever seen. Your sister is about to fold it up and put it in her pocket. I''ve never seen an image like this before. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon (tie) ', '2008-01-05 00:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4362244, 627151, 50695, '<td valign="top">Magnificent. Terrifying. Perfect multi-layered interpretation of the challenge. (The face is isolated by contrast with the darkness around it, while the darkness is emphasized by the lightness around it, which in turn brings out the face.)<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon (tie) <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Magnificent. Terrifying. Perfect multi-layered interpretation of the challenge. (The face is isolated by contrast with the darkness around it, while the darkness is emphasized by the lightness around it, which in turn brings out the face.) Posthumous Yellow Ribbon (tie) ', '2008-01-05 00:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4362245, 627545, 50695, '<td valign="top">This image is so perfect it almost disappears, like it doesn''t even need to be looked at. The leaf is magnificent, but the background is pure spirit. It''s like I''m seeing the creation of the universe, God asking for light, word becoming flesh, the first time a neutron met an electron.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon (tie) <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This image is so perfect it almost disappears, like it doesn''t even need to be looked at. The leaf is magnificent, but the background is pure spirit. It''s like I''m seeing the creation of the universe, God asking for light, word becoming flesh, the first time a neutron met an electron. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon (tie) ', '2008-01-05 00:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4362247, 627537, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is so unreal. Everything is too big. One of the lights turned into a candy cane. The dance of light and fog is perfect.</td>', 'This is so unreal. Everything is too big. One of the lights turned into a candy cane. The dance of light and fog is perfect.', '2008-01-05 00:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4362248, 627512, 50695, '<td valign="top">A wonderful Puck figure dancing from Shakespeare to the shore.</td>', 'A wonderful Puck figure dancing from Shakespeare to the shore.', '2008-01-05 00:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4362249, 626951, 50695, '<td valign="top">How does an artist kick the sea? Like this. I love feet and shoes, and the undulating shorewater only adds to the sensuality.</td>', 'How does an artist kick the sea? Like this. I love feet and shoes, and the undulating shorewater only adds to the sensuality.', '2008-01-05 00:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4362253, 627118, 50695, '<td valign="top">Incredible layering, with different layers at different depths seemingly coming into contact with each other. The challenge is met perfectly, seamlessly, emphatically. But what I love most of all are those waves that look like rocks from Heaven.</td>', 'Incredible layering, with different layers at different depths seemingly coming into contact with each other. The challenge is met perfectly, seamlessly, emphatically. But what I love most of all are those waves that look like rocks from Heaven.', '2008-01-05 00:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4362254, 627260, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, dynamic composition, good execution of challenge.</td>', 'Nice capture, dynamic composition, good execution of challenge.', '2008-01-05 00:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4362256, 627037, 50695, '<td valign="top">Pardon me, but I am in love with your dog. POV is perfect, an outstanding shot.</td>', 'Pardon me, but I am in love with your dog. POV is perfect, an outstanding shot.', '2008-01-05 00:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4362258, 627548, 50695, '<td valign="top">a stunning, disorienting shot, and the title is like a bolt from the blue.</td>', 'a stunning, disorienting shot, and the title is like a bolt from the blue.', '2008-01-05 00:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4362261, 627129, 50695, '<td valign="top">a very good example of this genre.</td>', 'a very good example of this genre.', '2008-01-05 00:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4362265, 627057, 50695, '<td valign="top">remarkable capture, perfectly executed. The only downside is that the close-up nature of the shot keeps the composition from adding anything.</td>', 'remarkable capture, perfectly executed. The only downside is that the close-up nature of the shot keeps the composition from adding anything.', '2008-01-05 00:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4362270, 626818, 50695, '<td valign="top">Very good execution of the challenge. I love how the greens and highlights of her outfit correspond to the colors of the greenery around her. Exciting composition.</td>', 'Very good execution of the challenge. I love how the greens and highlights of her outfit correspond to the colors of the greenery around her. Exciting composition.', '2008-01-05 00:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
