(4366419, 627402, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition and point of view are not, IMHO, very interesting, but I really love the silvery tones on the tulip and the textures of the snow. Excellent try!</td>', 'The composition and point of view are not, IMHO, very interesting, but I really love the silvery tones on the tulip and the textures of the snow. Excellent try!', '2008-01-06 14:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4366437, 627426, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, here''s my two cents. :)<br/>The image is lacking contrast - the range of tones is low. There is only black and some dark greys here, which make the image feel dark and under-exposed. I''ve also had difficulty with black and white pictures like this. If I try to brighten it up any more I end up with a grainy, unpleasant photo. My only suggestion to fix this might be to try to create some better lighting. Very nice try though - I like the whole set-up you have here with the necklace and the subject''s expression. Hope this was a little helpful! :)</td>', 'Well, here''s my two cents. :)The image is lacking contrast - the range of tones is low. There is only black and some dark greys here, which make the image feel dark and under-exposed. I''ve also had difficulty with black and white pictures like this. If I try to brighten it up any more I end up with a grainy, unpleasant photo. My only suggestion to fix this might be to try to create some better lighting. Very nice try though - I like the whole set-up you have here with the necklace and the subject''s expression. Hope this was a little helpful! :)', '2008-01-06 14:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4366441, 626064, 63269, '<td valign="top">I admit I do not find this very interesting... but I certainly like the rich blue colors a lot, and the border works nicely. Good try! :)</td>', 'I admit I do not find this very interesting... but I certainly like the rich blue colors a lot, and the border works nicely. Good try! :)', '2008-01-06 14:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4366443, 626523, 63269, '<td valign="top">very interesting use of the high-key, high-contrast effect here....I like the hint of textures and the composition. Well done!</td>', 'very interesting use of the high-key, high-contrast effect here....I like the hint of textures and the composition. Well done!', '2008-01-06 14:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4366447, 626199, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice! My only suggestion to enhance this shot would be to try for a different composition. Perhaps taking the shot at an angle, so that the branch created a diagonal line would make this slightly more interesting to look at...however, the strong contrasts here are great!</td>', 'Nice! My only suggestion to enhance this shot would be to try for a different composition. Perhaps taking the shot at an angle, so that the branch created a diagonal line would make this slightly more interesting to look at...however, the strong contrasts here are great!', '2008-01-06 14:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4366454, 627538, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat! I like the way the composition challenges me to really look at the image. It''s as though the egg is jumping out and <i>demanding </i>my attention. ;) I also like the lighting, and the wonderful contrasts. The border works very nicely here! My only complaint would be that the highlight on the closest egg looks burned out - it''s not pure white. (at least not on my screen) but that is a minor nit-pick. Great photo.</td>', 'Neat! I like the way the composition challenges me to really look at the image. It''s as though the egg is jumping out and demanding my attention. ;) I also like the lighting, and the wonderful contrasts. The border works very nicely here! My only complaint would be that the highlight on the closest egg looks burned out - it''s not pure white. (at least not on my screen) but that is a minor nit-pick. Great photo.', '2008-01-06 14:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4366459, 626448, 63269, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF and colors work nicely here, and something about the black pole in the background balances the composition perfectly.</td>', 'The shallow DOF and colors work nicely here, and something about the black pole in the background balances the composition perfectly.', '2008-01-06 14:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
