(4367737, 627533, 29011, '<td valign="top">Nice soft lighting :)<br/>Wouldn''t have minding a little contrat boost to this one, to help isolate the flowers even more and darken the background completely pitch black.</td>', 'Nice soft lighting :)Wouldn''t have minding a little contrat boost to this one, to help isolate the flowers even more and darken the background completely pitch black.', '2008-01-06 22:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
