(4367857, 627129, 74371, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen this one cropped closer. Might have taken away some of the overall affect, but the birds in the water and that one on the reed , if larger, I do believe might have brought the feeling of tranquility more to the forefront.<br/> <br/>Great shot, no matter what! (8)</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen this one cropped closer. Might have taken away some of the overall affect, but the birds in the water and that one on the reed , if larger, I do believe might have brought the feeling of tranquility more to the forefront. Great shot, no matter what! (8)', '2008-01-06 23:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4367865, 627208, 74371, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite! Outstanding setup, lighting and detail!! (10)</td>', 'This is my favorite! Outstanding setup, lighting and detail!! (10)', '2008-01-06 23:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4367881, 627319, 57882, '<td valign="top">beautiful.</td>', 'beautiful.', '2008-01-06 23:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4367882, 627356, 74371, '<td valign="top">I am mixed about this photo. My heart tells me that the eye should be more in focus, but my mind says that mascara is applied to the eyelashes. But then, I AM a guy and am not really sure if that is what mascara is/does. So, I will go with what could possibly be a mixed up mind and say...nice shot! (8)</td>', 'I am mixed about this photo. My heart tells me that the eye should be more in focus, but my mind says that mascara is applied to the eyelashes. But then, I AM a guy and am not really sure if that is what mascara is/does. So, I will go with what could possibly be a mixed up mind and say...nice shot! (8)', '2008-01-06 23:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
