(4368297, 626199, 62318, '<td valign="top">That squirrel looks rabid, watch out. My two dogs eat squirrels for lunch, well just the one. Brings one in every year. <br/> <br/>The photo itself has some pretty nice lines, the pose of the squirrel really has a lot of interest and the processing is well done!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-07 15:04:25.</i></td>', 'That squirrel looks rabid, watch out. My two dogs eat squirrels for lunch, well just the one. Brings one in every year.  The photo itself has some pretty nice lines, the pose of the squirrel really has a lot of interest and the processing is well done!', '2008-01-07 00:48:25.000000', '2008-01-07 15:04:25.000000', 0),
(4368301, 627319, 17203, '<td valign="top">Wow- awesome effort to get the rays! The result was certainly worth it. ;-)</td>', 'Wow- awesome effort to get the rays! The result was certainly worth it. ;-)', '2008-01-07 00:49:22.000000', NULL, 0),
