(4368350, 627321, 62318, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Very sharp with the birds really giving a lot of life to the photo.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. Very sharp with the birds really giving a lot of life to the photo.', '2008-01-07 00:59:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368351, 625835, 74371, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot, Judi!!  I wish I could have gotten farther in my voting...this would have been a 10 from me.<br/> <br/>You have the perfect model in your daughter. Her face is the kind that is gonna make a ton of guys cry in a few years...if she isn''t already!! I hadn''t realized she was your daughter until reading it here. I think she was the model you used for "Fragile" in the Deja Vu III Challenge, wasn''t she.  Can definitely see where she gets her looks!!<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon!!</td>', 'What a beautiful shot, Judi!!  I wish I could have gotten farther in my voting...this would have been a 10 from me. You have the perfect model in your daughter. Her face is the kind that is gonna make a ton of guys cry in a few years...if she isn''t already!! I hadn''t realized she was your daughter until reading it here. I think she was the model you used for "Fragile" in the Deja Vu III Challenge, wasn''t she.  Can definitely see where she gets her looks!! Congrats on the ribbon!!', '2008-01-07 01:00:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368356, 626541, 33068, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed &amp; wonderful textures.  Congrats on the blue.</td>', 'Nicely composed & wonderful textures.  Congrats on the blue.', '2008-01-07 01:01:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368359, 626541, 33352, '<td valign="top">Congratualations Enzo, really captured the theme in this shot.</td>', 'Congratualations Enzo, really captured the theme in this shot.', '2008-01-07 01:02:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368363, 625835, 70828, '<td valign="top">... a pocket model Judi! Simply stunning. Grats</td>', '... a pocket model Judi! Simply stunning. Grats', '2008-01-07 01:04:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368365, 625835, 34938, '<td valign="top">Wow Judi, the views on this are stratospheric! Looks like that''s continuing post challenge...<br/> <br/>Going in as a Fave for me...</td>', 'Wow Judi, the views on this are stratospheric! Looks like that''s continuing post challenge... Going in as a Fave for me...', '2008-01-07 01:05:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368370, 625845, 67697, '<td valign="top">You''re crazy - it is a fun shot.  And it''s gorgeous!  Cold metal, cold ground, contrasting with the beautiful warm red - and then joined together by the festive tree.  It''s great!</td>', 'You''re crazy - it is a fun shot.  And it''s gorgeous!  Cold metal, cold ground, contrasting with the beautiful warm red - and then joined together by the festive tree.  It''s great!', '2008-01-07 01:06:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368376, 625835, 33352, '<td valign="top">Another top entry Judi, haveing such a talented and photogenic subject is a great advantage,with your skills in capturing this talent is a masterpiece in its self.</td>', 'Another top entry Judi, haveing such a talented and photogenic subject is a great advantage,with your skills in capturing this talent is a masterpiece in its self.', '2008-01-07 01:08:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368379, 627252, 67697, '<td valign="top">Do you know how long it took me to get a brown?  Almost a year! lol<br/> <br/>I think my fave part of this is that you used a brown background and contrasted that with all the brown chocolate which have been hiddin in all the pretty wrappers.  I''m sure that is not what you were going for (I have a very different way of looking at things.)  But I hope you keep on trying!</td>', 'Do you know how long it took me to get a brown?  Almost a year! lol I think my fave part of this is that you used a brown background and contrasted that with all the brown chocolate which have been hiddin in all the pretty wrappers.  I''m sure that is not what you were going for (I have a very different way of looking at things.)  But I hope you keep on trying!', '2008-01-07 01:10:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368381, 626523, 33352, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the front page.</td>', 'Congratulations on the front page.', '2008-01-07 01:10:11.000000', NULL, 0),
