(4368384, 625835, 15305, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!!! I can''t wait to hear how you managed the pose...</td>', 'Congratulations!!! I can''t wait to hear how you managed the pose...', '2008-01-07 01:11:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368386, 625845, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like that you enter non-FS.  Seems I always enjoy your submissions, so keep sticking them in please.</td>', 'I like that you enter non-FS.  Seems I always enjoy your submissions, so keep sticking them in please.', '2008-01-07 01:11:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368389, 626541, 52549, '<td valign="top">Huge congrats on the blue, Enzo. This is a most stunningly beautiful image and just so perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'Huge congrats on the blue, Enzo. This is a most stunningly beautiful image and just so perfect for the challenge.', '2008-01-07 01:13:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368391, 626523, 15305, '<td valign="top">Beatiful shot and great postprocessing. Congratulations on the top 10!!</td>', 'Beatiful shot and great postprocessing. Congratulations on the top 10!!', '2008-01-07 01:14:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368394, 627032, 30982, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a massive amount of talent in your family.  If I''m not mistaken, you, 2mccs, and pointandshoot are all somehow related, yes?  What I find interesting is a similarity in styles.  Or maybe it''s just that I like the work all three of you do.  I am one of your 10s on this - I REALLY like the way the snow provides grain, I love the composition.  Keep doing what you do - I enjoy the results!</td>', 'There seems to be a massive amount of talent in your family.  If I''m not mistaken, you, 2mccs, and pointandshoot are all somehow related, yes?  What I find interesting is a similarity in styles.  Or maybe it''s just that I like the work all three of you do.  I am one of your 10s on this - I REALLY like the way the snow provides grain, I love the composition.  Keep doing what you do - I enjoy the results!', '2008-01-07 01:14:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368397, 627319, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wow, Steve! What a beautiful image and so very worthy of a ribbon. Congratulations.</td>', 'Wow, Steve! What a beautiful image and so very worthy of a ribbon. Congratulations.', '2008-01-07 01:14:29.000000', NULL, 0),
