(4368409, 627540, 30982, '<td valign="top">I often don''t comment on some of the shots I rank high if I expect them to do very well.  This was one of those - I really expected this to be much higher.  Just shows what I know, huh?  Nice work.  Lovely combination of serenity and starkness.</td>', 'I often don''t comment on some of the shots I rank high if I expect them to do very well.  This was one of those - I really expected this to be much higher.  Just shows what I know, huh?  Nice work.  Lovely combination of serenity and starkness.', '2008-01-07 01:17:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368410, 625835, 33068, '<td valign="top">Love the pose &amp; BW treatment.  Beautiful daughter you have.  Congrats on the yellow.</td>', 'Love the pose & BW treatment.  Beautiful daughter you have.  Congrats on the yellow.', '2008-01-07 01:17:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368414, 627145, 55956, '<td valign="top">wow before the challenge start you said that you have a photo for 4.... congrats and many of this 4 :D</td>', 'wow before the challenge start you said that you have a photo for 4.... congrats and many of this 4 :D', '2008-01-07 01:19:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368417, 627037, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting to me that some see the background as "cluttered".  To me, the dog stands out quite well, not just isolated by the dark slacks, but by its look and its aliveness.  The rest is inanimate.  Very nicely seen and captured - thanks for entering it.</td>', 'It''s interesting to me that some see the background as "cluttered".  To me, the dog stands out quite well, not just isolated by the dark slacks, but by its look and its aliveness.  The rest is inanimate.  Very nicely seen and captured - thanks for entering it.', '2008-01-07 01:19:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368423, 627003, 73056, '<td valign="top">I thought this would definitely be in the top 3. It was fresh and creative. What a bummer.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-07 01:25:26.</i></td>', 'I thought this would definitely be in the top 3. It was fresh and creative. What a bummer.', '2008-01-07 01:22:56.000000', '2008-01-07 01:25:26.000000', 0),
