(4368444, 626879, 68504, '<td valign="top">This is exuberant! Most unusual and serendipitous contrast of color lifeform and lines, lines, lines.</td>', 'This is exuberant! Most unusual and serendipitous contrast of color lifeform and lines, lines, lines.', '2008-01-07 01:35:57.000000', NULL, 0),
