(4368447, 626523, 65319, '<td valign="top">Congrats on Top 10!!!  This photo has a haunting melody and just sings beauty and romance!!!</td>', 'Congrats on Top 10!!!  This photo has a haunting melody and just sings beauty and romance!!!', '2008-01-07 01:38:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368449, 626541, 27133, '<td valign="top">Heyyyyyyyyyyyyy congrats on a great image.  Beautiful details.</td>', 'Heyyyyyyyyyyyyy congrats on a great image.  Beautiful details.', '2008-01-07 01:38:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368454, 626233, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not a bad picture by any means, but pictures of duckies and woodies and figurines have to really stand out to do well - they''ve been done a lot.  Definitely meets the challenge - hence the lots of 5s.  The 1s and 2s are probably from people who don''t like duckies or don''t like to see them in challenges.  It may be just a tad bit overexposed, but the composition is solid.  I''d say that this did what it did primarily due to subject matter.</td>', 'Not a bad picture by any means, but pictures of duckies and woodies and figurines have to really stand out to do well - they''ve been done a lot.  Definitely meets the challenge - hence the lots of 5s.  The 1s and 2s are probably from people who don''t like duckies or don''t like to see them in challenges.  It may be just a tad bit overexposed, but the composition is solid.  I''d say that this did what it did primarily due to subject matter.', '2008-01-07 01:43:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368455, 627319, 27133, '<td valign="top">Awesome.....so creative.</td>', 'Awesome.....so creative.', '2008-01-07 01:43:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368456, 626523, 53814, '<td valign="top">It''s great to see something so creative break the top 10. Congratulations on putting a new shot on your portfolio front page.</td>', 'It''s great to see something so creative break the top 10. Congratulations on putting a new shot on your portfolio front page.', '2008-01-07 01:44:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4368457, 626541, 46601, '<td valign="top">Great shot and the out takes are breathtaking as well ... nice work ... even nicer that it''s taken in Aus!</td>', 'Great shot and the out takes are breathtaking as well ... nice work ... even nicer that it''s taken in Aus!', '2008-01-07 01:45:06.000000', NULL, 0),
