(4368652, 626492, 77192, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SoulMan1978:</b></div><hr/><i> I swore when I saw this shot, which is a good sign.<br/> <br/>The expression on the lion''s face is perfect, I love the framing and especially the light falling on his mane.<br/> <br/>It''s got a 10 from me (and a favourite), this might even break 8 overall if there''s any justice in the world.<br/> <br/>In short, the best photo I''ve seen on DPC in a fair long while, which is saying something considering the strength of the shots in this challenge alone. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>6.2704? You were robbed! Way underrated IMO</td>', 'Originally posted by SoulMan1978: I swore when I saw this shot, which is a good sign. The expression on the lion''s face is perfect, I love the framing and especially the light falling on his mane. It''s got a 10 from me (and a favourite), this might even break 8 overall if there''s any justice in the world. In short, the best photo I''ve seen on DPC in a fair long while, which is saying something considering the strength of the shots in this challenge alone.   6.2704? You were robbed! Way underrated IMO', '2008-01-07 03:55:16.000000', NULL, 0),
