(4369046, 626756, 57229, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done, Julianne. Depth of field is a viable method (not to say one of the most effective) of isolating the subject. You used colour and tone as well so it was triple whammy, or at least double :-)<br/> <br/>I think wow factor carried the day for the winners in this challenge. You''ve actually got a lot of that, but maybe it''s just-another-flower-pic in the eyes of many.<br/> <br/>Not a sscore to be sniffed at, but less than you deserve.<br/> <br/>Lovely definition and contour on the petals.</td>', 'Beautifully done, Julianne. Depth of field is a viable method (not to say one of the most effective) of isolating the subject. You used colour and tone as well so it was triple whammy, or at least double :-) I think wow factor carried the day for the winners in this challenge. You''ve actually got a lot of that, but maybe it''s just-another-flower-pic in the eyes of many. Not a sscore to be sniffed at, but less than you deserve. Lovely definition and contour on the petals.', '2008-01-07 08:54:37.000000', NULL, 0),
