(4369187, 627495, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, I agree 100% Roz!   This is way underrated for the WRONG reasons.  And its one thing I truly hate about how people vote on dpChallenge.   It slaps down people for having any creativity and soul that meanders outside a narrow contrived box!  I truly hate that!!<br/> <br/>This photo is stunning.  The colors really strike me!</td>', 'Oh, I agree 100% Roz!   This is way underrated for the WRONG reasons.  And its one thing I truly hate about how people vote on dpChallenge.   It slaps down people for having any creativity and soul that meanders outside a narrow contrived box!  I truly hate that!! This photo is stunning.  The colors really strike me!', '2008-01-07 09:47:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4369189, 627426, 65035, '<td valign="top">I love the expression on her face although I wish her mouth were closed, just the slight hint of teeth is a bit distracting when it''s such a dark image. The lighting is lovely on her face. I''m a cropping nutter but I''d try cropping most of the top and left side which would put her face in the upper quarter, you might hate that idea, that''s OK. Also just a slight curve to lift her skin tone just a touch I think would have made a difference. Feel free to pm me if I''m not making sense. She''s a very beautiful girl and you have captured that well.</td>', 'I love the expression on her face although I wish her mouth were closed, just the slight hint of teeth is a bit distracting when it''s such a dark image. The lighting is lovely on her face. I''m a cropping nutter but I''d try cropping most of the top and left side which would put her face in the upper quarter, you might hate that idea, that''s OK. Also just a slight curve to lift her skin tone just a touch I think would have made a difference. Feel free to pm me if I''m not making sense. She''s a very beautiful girl and you have captured that well.', '2008-01-07 09:48:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4369207, 625835, 40580, '<td valign="top">I thought she looked a little young.<br/> <br/>Great shot.  Oh and <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=44058" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Kita</a> has some nice pictures herself.  It''s sad when a 10 year old takes better pictures than you (let her know I said that please).<br/> <br/>The first thing I thought of when I saw this image is from a scary movie and it''s trailer.  The little boy is climbing the stairs and his hind feet flip over his body to climb the stairs.<br/> <br/>Of course, this is a nicer image.</td>', 'I thought she looked a little young. Great shot.  Oh and  Kita has some nice pictures herself.  It''s sad when a 10 year old takes better pictures than you (let her know I said that please). The first thing I thought of when I saw this image is from a scary movie and it''s trailer.  The little boy is climbing the stairs and his hind feet flip over his body to climb the stairs. Of course, this is a nicer image.', '2008-01-07 09:52:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4369216, 625845, 65035, '<td valign="top">I really like this, all those sharp urban looking rectangles and lines contrasting with the festive little tree and the irregular shapes of the water. The colours are stunning, it''s a beautiful photo.</td>', 'I really like this, all those sharp urban looking rectangles and lines contrasting with the festive little tree and the irregular shapes of the water. The colours are stunning, it''s a beautiful photo.', '2008-01-07 09:54:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4369222, 627353, 40580, '<td valign="top">Thanks again 1m1A for the comment.  This is the first time I only received one comment.  I guess that says something about the photo.  It''s okay, but not good enough and nobody had anything to say about it.<br/> <br/>I''ll do better next time.</td>', 'Thanks again 1m1A for the comment.  This is the first time I only received one comment.  I guess that says something about the photo.  It''s okay, but not good enough and nobody had anything to say about it. I''ll do better next time.', '2008-01-07 09:55:37.000000', NULL, 0),
