(4369251, 627290, 65035, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen on the border Bear but the DoF is beautiful and the selective desat is perfect for this. His legs do look a little uncomfortable but I''ve never tried to pose a woody so I''ve no idea how hard it is, the arms and head are lovely though.</td>', 'I''m not keen on the border Bear but the DoF is beautiful and the selective desat is perfect for this. His legs do look a little uncomfortable but I''ve never tried to pose a woody so I''ve no idea how hard it is, the arms and head are lovely though.', '2008-01-07 10:00:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4369273, 627542, 65035, '<td valign="top">This made me smile when I came across it, I love the title and the warmth of her face contrasting with the snow. I also like that it seems such a big job for such a little girl but her expression says she''s enjoying the challenge. My nit pick is that the diagonal line across the top draws my eye, I like it better cropped just below the path. Just because it makes it easier for me to focus on the subject and I''m lazy that way.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-07 10:09:01.</i></td>', 'This made me smile when I came across it, I love the title and the warmth of her face contrasting with the snow. I also like that it seems such a big job for such a little girl but her expression says she''s enjoying the challenge. My nit pick is that the diagonal line across the top draws my eye, I like it better cropped just below the path. Just because it makes it easier for me to focus on the subject and I''m lazy that way.', '2008-01-07 10:07:38.000000', '2008-01-07 10:09:01.000000', 0),
