(4370441, 625835, 23478, '<td valign="top">Sweet foto Judi!!  Congrats on the ribbon and this was one of the few that I gave a "10" during the challenge.  Great shot and wonderful comments.  Thanks for sharing your talent.</td>', 'Sweet foto Judi!!  Congrats on the ribbon and this was one of the few that I gave a "10" during the challenge.  Great shot and wonderful comments.  Thanks for sharing your talent.', '2008-01-07 14:40:30.000000', NULL, 0),
