(4370513, 627182, 62318, '<td valign="top">I like the line of the stairwell next to the curved back of the cat. I also like the nice rich tones of the red. A good photo for the challenge and a cute kitty.</td>', 'I like the line of the stairwell next to the curved back of the cat. I also like the nice rich tones of the red. A good photo for the challenge and a cute kitty.', '2008-01-07 15:03:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370521, 627375, 62318, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nice textures as usually. I like the snow on the face as I think it really makes the shot.</td>', 'Wow, very nice textures as usually. I like the snow on the face as I think it really makes the shot.', '2008-01-07 15:05:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370541, 625835, 69325, '<td valign="top">well, you know i love your shots and i have told you before what a beautiful girl you have,you have recieved many positive comments on this shot, all heavily deserved. my only reservation (and please understand i am not trying to be a trouble maker) is that the pose seemd just a TAD provacative for a 10 year old. it probably wouldnt jump out at me like that except for the fact that she looks like she may be nude. i do love the photo in and of itself. of course as always its just one mans opinion.</td>', 'well, you know i love your shots and i have told you before what a beautiful girl you have,you have recieved many positive comments on this shot, all heavily deserved. my only reservation (and please understand i am not trying to be a trouble maker) is that the pose seemd just a TAD provacative for a 10 year old. it probably wouldnt jump out at me like that except for the fact that she looks like she may be nude. i do love the photo in and of itself. of course as always its just one mans opinion.', '2008-01-07 15:12:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370553, 626756, 62318, '<td valign="top">Another lovely flower shot. I like how the orange pops against the dark background.</td>', 'Another lovely flower shot. I like how the orange pops against the dark background.', '2008-01-07 15:17:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370572, 627426, 62318, '<td valign="top">A very nice solemn moment. I think the tone contrast is excellent. Those two things combined make a terrific image. I wonder if a slightly tighter crop would have had better reaction from the voters (I''ll post in the Spleen Thread of an example)</td>', 'A very nice solemn moment. I think the tone contrast is excellent. Those two things combined make a terrific image. I wonder if a slightly tighter crop would have had better reaction from the voters (I''ll post in the Spleen Thread of an example)', '2008-01-07 15:23:31.000000', NULL, 0),
