(4370624, 627191, 62318, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed this one while voting in the challenge. The blues really contrast nicely against the wall. What I especially liked was the wall, not your typical static wall, but rather full of texture and realism that reflects on the hard hats nicely.</td>', 'I really enjoyed this one while voting in the challenge. The blues really contrast nicely against the wall. What I especially liked was the wall, not your typical static wall, but rather full of texture and realism that reflects on the hard hats nicely.', '2008-01-07 15:42:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370627, 627517, 78196, '<td valign="top">Wow, posthumous ribbon in your first entry - very jealous! Congrats on a great shot.</td>', 'Wow, posthumous ribbon in your first entry - very jealous! Congrats on a great shot.', '2008-01-07 15:43:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370633, 627492, 85886, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed this scored/placed where it did - I had it down to be much higher.  This seems to have been a very loosely interpreted challenge by all...</td>', 'I''m amazed this scored/placed where it did - I had it down to be much higher.  This seems to have been a very loosely interpreted challenge by all...', '2008-01-07 15:44:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370657, 625835, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by smardaz:</b></div><hr/><i> well, you know i love your shots and i have told you before what a beautiful girl you have,you have received many positive comments on this shot, all heavily deserved. my only reservation (and please understand i am not trying to be a trouble maker) is that the pose seem just a TAD provocative for a 10 year old. it probably wouldn''t jump out at me like that except for the fact that she looks like she may be nude. i do love the photo in and of itself. of course as always its just one mans opinion. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hahahaha..thankyou for that.  Do you know....that I have been waiting all week for someone to be brave enough to come forward and say what you said.  That thought did cross both Kita and my mind before I submitted it....but I assured her that after that last entry of mine being falsely mistaken as nude, that the most important thing was that we both knew that she was fully clothed.<br/> <br/>So thankyou...for being brave...and honest.</td>', 'Originally posted by smardaz: well, you know i love your shots and i have told you before what a beautiful girl you have,you have received many positive comments on this shot, all heavily deserved. my only reservation (and please understand i am not trying to be a trouble maker) is that the pose seem just a TAD provocative for a 10 year old. it probably wouldn''t jump out at me like that except for the fact that she looks like she may be nude. i do love the photo in and of itself. of course as always its just one mans opinion.   Hahahaha..thankyou for that.  Do you know....that I have been waiting all week for someone to be brave enough to come forward and say what you said.  That thought did cross both Kita and my mind before I submitted it....but I assured her that after that last entry of mine being falsely mistaken as nude, that the most important thing was that we both knew that she was fully clothed. So thankyou...for being brave...and honest.', '2008-01-07 15:53:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370661, 627426, 50695, '<td valign="top">low 4s??? I dunno how that happened.</td>', 'low 4s??? I dunno how that happened.', '2008-01-07 15:54:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370670, 627308, 50695, '<td valign="top">the lighting''s great, actually. and so is the composition. sometimes a shot like this transforms into pure image. you don''t quite transcend being a bottle and a box of tissues, but you come close. I gave it a 6.</td>', 'the lighting''s great, actually. and so is the composition. sometimes a shot like this transforms into pure image. you don''t quite transcend being a bottle and a box of tissues, but you come close. I gave it a 6.', '2008-01-07 15:57:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370675, 627003, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very nice processing, the colors really jump out at you and make a wonderful contrast. The moving skaters really make the photo what it is.</td>', 'Very nice processing, the colors really jump out at you and make a wonderful contrast. The moving skaters really make the photo what it is.', '2008-01-07 15:58:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370682, 625835, 70852, '<td valign="top">What a stunning image! The pose and composition and expression on her face is breathtaking. Well done!</td>', 'What a stunning image! The pose and composition and expression on her face is breathtaking. Well done!', '2008-01-07 16:06:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370698, 625835, 36988, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Judi... simply beautiful. R</td>', 'Beautiful Judi... simply beautiful. R', '2008-01-07 16:18:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370702, 626213, 16241, '<td valign="top">where is this?  i painted this very image a while back, strange.</td>', 'where is this?  i painted this very image a while back, strange.', '2008-01-07 16:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370738, 627182, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''ll never understand the "1" votes. I almost always have at least a couple. I''ve probably said so before, but there are darn few "bad" photos on this site.<br/> <br/>I think this has excellent contrast, between the dark and light, and between the beautiful grooming and the decay. The eye is a startling contrast to the rest of the image, and you managed to capture quite a bit of detail in that white fur. Good going.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-07 16:37:31.</i></td>', 'I''ll never understand the "1" votes. I almost always have at least a couple. I''ve probably said so before, but there are darn few "bad" photos on this site. I think this has excellent contrast, between the dark and light, and between the beautiful grooming and the decay. The eye is a startling contrast to the rest of the image, and you managed to capture quite a bit of detail in that white fur. Good going.', '2008-01-07 16:36:10.000000', '2008-01-07 16:37:31.000000', 0),
(4370813, 626541, 53147, '<td valign="top">Look at you go Enzo. Great image, amazing score. Me and Oliver are going to be gunning for you this year. Watch your back. ;)</td>', 'Look at you go Enzo. Great image, amazing score. Me and Oliver are going to be gunning for you this year. Watch your back. ;)', '2008-01-07 16:57:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370821, 627191, 68035, '<td valign="top">Deb<br/> <br/>nice score and nice finished.  I quite liked the subtlty of this shot both in the terms of the slightly muted - yet still very appealing - colours and the fact that there was more than one hat on the pegs, but that one of them stood out through its red flashings.  A very good example of how something that thousands of people would walk by without a second glance at can be made to be a visual treat</td>', 'Deb nice score and nice finished.  I quite liked the subtlty of this shot both in the terms of the slightly muted - yet still very appealing - colours and the fact that there was more than one hat on the pegs, but that one of them stood out through its red flashings.  A very good example of how something that thousands of people would walk by without a second glance at can be made to be a visual treat', '2008-01-07 16:58:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370831, 625545, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great bokeh and composition which really gave this shot a 3D feel.  I also love (and am slightly envious of) the fact that whilst many DPCers are shivering in the winter you have got cotton beginning to bloom!<br/> <br/>Great contrast of colours as well with the white and browns</td>', 'Great bokeh and composition which really gave this shot a 3D feel.  I also love (and am slightly envious of) the fact that whilst many DPCers are shivering in the winter you have got cotton beginning to bloom! Great contrast of colours as well with the white and browns', '2008-01-07 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370841, 626603, 77192, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SoulMan1978:</b></div><hr/><i> lol. IreneM?  This works very well indeed, and I love the title </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Nice work again :-) Sorry I mistook you for Irene - I did that twice in the challenge and was wrong twice lol</td>', 'Originally posted by SoulMan1978: lol. IreneM?  This works very well indeed, and I love the title   Nice work again :-) Sorry I mistook you for Irene - I did that twice in the challenge and was wrong twice lol', '2008-01-07 17:02:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4370847, 627437, 77192, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SoulMan1978:</b></div><hr/><i> IreneM?<br/> <br/>(lol this is the 2nd shot this challenge I guessed was Irene''s, got to be wrong at least once ;-)  ) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>For the record, I was wrong twice lol. Congrats on a great shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by SoulMan1978: IreneM? (lol this is the 2nd shot this challenge I guessed was Irene''s, got to be wrong at least once ;-)  )   For the record, I was wrong twice lol. Congrats on a great shot.', '2008-01-07 17:03:51.000000', NULL, 0),
