(4370945, 625835, 66348, '<td valign="top">This is just an incredible shot Judi, congrats on amazing shot with great contrast and composition. Just an amazing portrait and IMO should have been the blue. I wish I could find that troll that gave you a 1 and have some alone time with him/her in an alley with no witnesses. :) Anyway congrats again on a breathtaking shot.</td>', 'This is just an incredible shot Judi, congrats on amazing shot with great contrast and composition. Just an amazing portrait and IMO should have been the blue. I wish I could find that troll that gave you a 1 and have some alone time with him/her in an alley with no witnesses. :) Anyway congrats again on a breathtaking shot.', '2008-01-07 17:44:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4371030, 626541, 86056, '<td valign="top">the sigma 10-20 is such an amazing lens. i love mine. it looks like you love yours too..... =]</td>', 'the sigma 10-20 is such an amazing lens. i love mine. it looks like you love yours too..... =]', '2008-01-07 18:11:40.000000', NULL, 0),
