(4371841, 625835, 60915, '<td valign="top">I think you''re gonna have your hands full in a few years when all the boys come a knockin'' on your door!! : )<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon, Judi! : )</td>', 'I think you''re gonna have your hands full in a few years when all the boys come a knockin'' on your door!! : ) Congrats on the ribbon, Judi! : )', '2008-01-07 21:13:40.000000', NULL, 0),
