(4372513, 625835, 40580, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kita:</b></div><hr/><i>I''m just doing a pose for the camera but I didn''t know it will offend you. For that I''m sorry. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh no offence taken.  It''s a great shot and pose.  I gave it a high score.  But a 16x24 print?  Maybe it''s because I''m a dad, but I wouldn''t be selling 16x24 prints of my girl.<br/> <br/>Of course, I do live in a different place and I''m pretty Catholic too.</td>', 'Originally posted by Kita:I''m just doing a pose for the camera but I didn''t know it will offend you. For that I''m sorry.   Oh no offence taken.  It''s a great shot and pose.  I gave it a high score.  But a 16x24 print?  Maybe it''s because I''m a dad, but I wouldn''t be selling 16x24 prints of my girl. Of course, I do live in a different place and I''m pretty Catholic too.', '2008-01-08 00:09:08.000000', NULL, 0),
