(4373492, 627426, 66597, '<td valign="top">Bob - I really like this, and think you were brave to go with a portrait with eyes closed. I think it might be even stronger with some area cropped from the top and right, but it sets a mood and is very interesting. Edit to add: I just saw your score and am a bit incredulous. Any photo that tells a story is worth a lot more than a 4.3!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-08 09:53:52.</i></td>', 'Bob - I really like this, and think you were brave to go with a portrait with eyes closed. I think it might be even stronger with some area cropped from the top and right, but it sets a mood and is very interesting. Edit to add: I just saw your score and am a bit incredulous. Any photo that tells a story is worth a lot more than a 4.3!', '2008-01-08 09:52:46.000000', '2008-01-08 09:53:52.000000', 0),
