(4373918, 625835, 22517, '<td valign="top">Wow, Judi, amazing shot! And a great model as well! This is so very original, I''m really amazed by it every time I look at it. The expression of Kita, combined with the amazing pose and the beautiful hair make this a wonderful image! Congratulations to both of you!</td>', 'Wow, Judi, amazing shot! And a great model as well! This is so very original, I''m really amazed by it every time I look at it. The expression of Kita, combined with the amazing pose and the beautiful hair make this a wonderful image! Congratulations to both of you!', '2008-01-08 12:20:39.000000', NULL, 0),
