(4374393, 625835, 66193, '<td valign="top">Judi, congrats on this wonderful image.  It was my favorite of the challenge by far.  I love the high key and the way her eyes look through you.  You are going to have your hands full in a few years scaring off the boys.  Get that shotgun ready!</td>', 'Judi, congrats on this wonderful image.  It was my favorite of the challenge by far.  I love the high key and the way her eyes look through you.  You are going to have your hands full in a few years scaring off the boys.  Get that shotgun ready!', '2008-01-08 15:15:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4374830, 625835, 69700, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Nullix:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kita:</b></div><hr/><i>I''m just doing a pose for the camera but I didn''t know it will offend you. For that I''m sorry. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh no offence taken.  It''s a great shot and pose.  I gave it a high score.  But a 16x24 print?  Maybe it''s because I''m a dad, but I wouldn''t be selling 16x24 prints of my girl.<br/> <br/>Of course, I do live in a different place and I''m pretty Catholic too. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think we have become overly concerned about photos of children.  There is no nudity in this photo, and while the child is beautiful, I don''t think it is sexual.<br/> <br/>Now anyone who wants to see nude children (including exposed genitial) , all they have to do is look at painting done by The Masters, including those on display in the Vatican.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Nullix: Originally posted by Kita:I''m just doing a pose for the camera but I didn''t know it will offend you. For that I''m sorry.   Oh no offence taken.  It''s a great shot and pose.  I gave it a high score.  But a 16x24 print?  Maybe it''s because I''m a dad, but I wouldn''t be selling 16x24 prints of my girl. Of course, I do live in a different place and I''m pretty Catholic too.   I think we have become overly concerned about photos of children.  There is no nudity in this photo, and while the child is beautiful, I don''t think it is sexual. Now anyone who wants to see nude children (including exposed genitial) , all they have to do is look at painting done by The Masters, including those on display in the Vatican. ', '2008-01-08 17:18:34.000000', NULL, 0),
