(4473274, 626991, 49804, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot, one thing i would advise with this, and probably the reason it didn''t score all that well, is that there isn''t enough contrast, bumping up the contrast a bit would add a whole lot to this shot.<br/>Nice composition and a very interesting idea, well executed as well, just a bit more contrast needed, nice shot.</td>', 'Very cool shot, one thing i would advise with this, and probably the reason it didn''t score all that well, is that there isn''t enough contrast, bumping up the contrast a bit would add a whole lot to this shot.Nice composition and a very interesting idea, well executed as well, just a bit more contrast needed, nice shot.', '2008-02-09 16:15:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4487303, 625835, 50034, '<td valign="top">Wow! Amazing image &amp; model!  I''m thinking some of those supermodels are going to have to retire very soon...because they won''t have any work when this little lady grows up!<br/> <br/>Dudesy!  What''s with the Outback!  Y''all got something in the water down there?  Two photographers...Same family...excellent photos on either side of the camera!  A photo monopoly going on here?  Hmmmmmmm?<br/> <br/>I know your book is great, but maybe don''t send it first!  Just bottle some of that water!  <br/> <br/>(A consistent score above 6.0,...Is that too much to ask!???  But you have a 10 yr. old here who is smackin'' my Hmmm Hmmm in the score department...)  O, well, I guess that''s why I have a teacher personality.  The saying is "Them what can does!  Them what can''t teaches!"  :}</td>', 'Wow! Amazing image & model!  I''m thinking some of those supermodels are going to have to retire very soon...because they won''t have any work when this little lady grows up! Dudesy!  What''s with the Outback!  Y''all got something in the water down there?  Two photographers...Same family...excellent photos on either side of the camera!  A photo monopoly going on here?  Hmmmmmmm? I know your book is great, but maybe don''t send it first!  Just bottle some of that water!   (A consistent score above 6.0,...Is that too much to ask!???  But you have a 10 yr. old here who is smackin'' my Hmmm Hmmm in the score department...)  O, well, I guess that''s why I have a teacher personality.  The saying is "Them what can does!  Them what can''t teaches!"  :}', '2008-02-14 18:11:19.000000', NULL, 0),
