(4810459, 627495, 76335, '<td valign="top">Classic case of the challenge title and challenge description being ever so slightly in disagreement; one says "object" the other says "subject". "Object" implies something very singular and discrete, and the challenge title is always the most visible. I agree with you though -- your "subject" is the group on the beach. <br/> <br/>The unnatrual blue color here really gives the photo its impact. It''s beautifully ominous, if that''s possible, and I think that''s what draws the viewer into it. Closer investigation reveals something far more foreboding and less pretty. So an expert job carrying your message from composition through to post-processing.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-22 12:31:26.</i></td>', 'Classic case of the challenge title and challenge description being ever so slightly in disagreement; one says "object" the other says "subject". "Object" implies something very singular and discrete, and the challenge title is always the most visible. I agree with you though -- your "subject" is the group on the beach.  The unnatrual blue color here really gives the photo its impact. It''s beautifully ominous, if that''s possible, and I think that''s what draws the viewer into it. Closer investigation reveals something far more foreboding and less pretty. So an expert job carrying your message from composition through to post-processing.', '2008-07-07 23:13:12.000000', '2008-07-22 13:31:26.000000', 0),
(4810469, 627495, 48228, '<td valign="top">Awesome processing here, thats for sure.....</td>', 'Awesome processing here, thats for sure.....', '2008-07-07 23:18:28.000000', NULL, 0),
