(4924924, 625974, 68769, '<td valign="top">Although not what you would call a DPC type shot, (it takes more than a moment to look and vote) It seems a few people enjoyed it. I think with a cleaned up back ground (noise) this would do well in a stock site. I also believe it would do well as a artwork, I can see it in a modern black and white room, or a nice contrast on a bright red wall. My wife watches a lot of home decorating shows ; p. BTW I do like it..</td>', 'Although not what you would call a DPC type shot, (it takes more than a moment to look and vote) It seems a few people enjoyed it. I think with a cleaned up back ground (noise) this would do well in a stock site. I also believe it would do well as a artwork, I can see it in a modern black and white room, or a nice contrast on a bright red wall. My wife watches a lot of home decorating shows ; p. BTW I do like it..', '2008-09-01 08:35:49.000000', NULL, 0),
